        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Hydrogen, from butanediol dehdrogenation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Hydrogen, from butanediol dehdrogenation
The multioutput-process "butanediol dehygrogenation " delivers the co-products butyrolactone and hydrogen. The allocation is based on stoechiometric calculation.;
UUID: 0b68a03d-d566-3b69-a05c-b4706963c8e5
Butanediol dehydrogenation including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world..
Technology: Dehygrogenation of butanediol
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions,  emissions, infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0b68a03d-d566-3b69-a05c-b4706963c8e5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
